n the UK with the highest death  toll in Europe a group of pediatricians  said keeping schools closed will  exacerbate inequality and risks scarring  the life chances of a generation of  young people  professor Fontana is himself a father of  four we were you worried when you sent  your children back to school they can  wear masks they can wash their hands  they can keep physical distance and it's  matter of self-discipline you know and  they have to learn but the professor  also acknowledged that maintaining that  discipline as he put it is much more  difficult for younger students Anthony  sure is Holly Holly Williams in Turkey  thanks
 

